mlua-sys 0.13.0 binds Luau 0.740's C API, the newest any mlua-sys binds. Luau 0.747 removed the integer type: lua.h's
type tags after LUA_TNUMBER moved down by one, and lua_tointeger64, lua_pushinteger64, luaL_checkinteger64,
luaL_optinteger64, luau_set_compile_constant_integer64 and luaopen_integer are gone. mlua 0.12 still names the integer
tag, lua_tointeger64 and luaopen_integer, so they stay as a tag no value has and Rust stubs (the integer library opens
as nothing, as in Luau 0.747); the rest is dropped. tools/vendor.mjs applies this to the crate before it sets the
bytecode version range.

